{"unit_id":"CZX2244__dsh-bilibili#card-zh","repo":"CZX2244/dsh-bilibili","commit":"c53af9dee30cf04ee759ac6857d5803196fb2a95","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-bilibili（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：分析哔哩哔哩视频并生成可读摘要。它向 DSH 注册视频提取、账号登录和环境检查工具；可获取元数据、字幕或语音转写、热门评论与弹幕，并按需下载视频、定位关键帧及生成画面描述。用户可先读文稿，再指定时间点抓帧。适合研究教程、演讲或其他 B 站视频。需要 Node.js 和 FFmpeg；无字幕转写可选必剪服务或本地 ASR，视觉描述可选本地或兼容 API 的视觉模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:203","lib/index.js:295","lib/index.js:390","lib/extractor.js:1490"]}
{"unit_id":"CZX2244__dsh-bilibili#card-en","repo":"CZX2244/dsh-bilibili","commit":"c53af9dee30cf04ee759ac6857d5803196fb2a95","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-bilibili is a DSH web plugin for analyzing Bilibili videos. It retrieves metadata, transcripts, comments, and danmaku, and captures frames at requested timestamps. Optional ASR transcribes videos without subtitles; optional vision models describe frames. Requires Node.js and FFmpeg.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:203","lib/index.js:295","lib/index.js:390","lib/extractor.js:1490"]}
