{"unit_id":"CZX2244__dsh-bilibili#feature-extract","repo":"CZX2244/dsh-bilibili","commit":"c53af9dee30cf04ee759ac6857d5803196fb2a95","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-bilibili 的功能「视频内容提取」：调用 bilibili_extract 并传入 B 站链接或 BV 号，返回视频元数据、字幕文稿、热门评论和弹幕摘要。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:203","lib/extractor.js:1490","lib/format.js:116"]}
